[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
bsdswitch has been installed.

Enable and start it:

  sysrc bsdswitchd_enable=YES
  service bsdswitchd start

Then log in on the console (or run bsdswitch-console) to run the first-boot
wizard. It prints the web UI URL and a one-time admin password.

To make the console menu appear when root logs in on the console, run
  /usr/local/share/bsdswitch/install.sh --console-only
EOM
}
]
